Workflow integrity
Make the end-to-end workflow reproducible with one documented source-of-truth command sequence or one orchestration script. At the moment the scaffold workflow, the experiment stack, and the live demo path are split across multiple directories.

Replace the broken machine-specific data linkage in `defect_classification_stack` with a repo-relative path strategy or an explicit setup step. The current macOS absolute symlink is not portable. make the data in the main faile and keep only raw in git: /home/ubu/Desktop/Assessment/zeroq_cup_classification_scaffold/data

